      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "It is an intentional design decision to decouple the VRChat client's volume input from the system level. Audio settings on the OS level can always be wrong, but it is not an application's responsibility to fix that.\n\nThat said, we are working on improving our voice audio stack in general which should help with related quality issues.",
