      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6593c4a4910c4a117fba8646|full_name}: The slider does function, it reduces the volume at which your voice is being sent. The AGC on the receiver may boost it back up to a certain level, but the slider itself does work. I just does not synchronize with or affect the OS level volume (what you see in your Windows settings).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
